{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GET-CLASS function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309580","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-CLASS-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-CLASS-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GET-CLASS-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GET-CLASS function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-CLASS-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the object reference for the Progress.Lang.Class\ninstance associated with the specified class or interface type.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-CLASS-function__syntax_GC18MV2693521\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d106993e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-CLASS-function__idGDL2HR2671089\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GET-CLASS ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">object-type-name</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">object-type-name </var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">Specifies the type name of an ABL or .NET class or interface\ntype, using the syntax described in the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Type-name-syntax.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Type-name-syntax.html\">Type-name syntax</a> reference\nentry. With an appropriate <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"USING-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/USING-statement.html\">USING statement</a>,\nyou can also specify an unqualified class or interface name alone.\nIf <var class=\"keyword varname\">object-type-name </var>is not the name of an existing\nABL class that can be found on PROPATH or (for Windows) a .NET class\nthat can be resolved based on the assemblies.xml file in use, a\ncompiler error will result.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-CLASS-function__example_GC18MW2693531\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d106993e151\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">Unlike\nthe GetClass() method of Progress.Lang.Class, GET-CLASS takes a type\nname as its argument instead of a CHARACTER expression that holds\na type name. As a result, USING statements can be applied to the\nargument, and the compiler checks the type name at compile time.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The\nfollowing code uses GET-CLASS to determine if acme.myObjs.CustObj\nis FINAL:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-CLASS-function__idGDL2HS2671095\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>USING Progress.Lang.*.\nUSING acme.myObjs.*.\n\nDEFINE VARIABLE lFinal AS LOGICAL.\n\nlFinal = GET-CLASS(CustObj):IsFinal().\nMESSAGE &quot;Is the class FINAL? &quot; lFinal VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-CLASS-function__see-also_GC18MX2693535\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d106993e183\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GetClass-method-Progress.Lang.Object.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GetClass-method-Progress.Lang.Object.html\">GetClass( ) method (Progress.Lang.Object)</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-BYTES-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-BYTES-function.html\">GET-BYTES function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-CODEPAGE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-CODEPAGE-function.html\">GET-CODEPAGE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309580","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GET-CLASS function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-CLASS-function.html","type":"Manual"}